ass="azs-text-btn" data-m6-older>Load older campaigns into selectors</button><h3>Campaign performance</h3><div class="azs-table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Campaign</th><th>Segment</th><th>Sent / Egypt</th><th>Accepted</th><th>Unique observed clicks</th><th>Purchases</th><th>Revenue / EGP</th><th>Provider units</th><th>Purchases / accepted</th></tr></thead><tbody id="m6-performance"></tbody></table></div><div class="azs-pagination"><button id="m6-report-prev" class="azs-btn secondary">Previous</button><span id="m6-report-page"></span><button id="m6-report-next" class="azs-btn secondary">Next</button></div><h3>Attributed orders — selected campaign</h3><p>Eligible EGP order gross remaining after refunds, as of reconciliation. Not cash collected or Analytics net sales. ROI / ROAS unavailable until monetary cost is verified.</p><div class="azs-table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Order</th><th>Created / Egypt</th><th>Status</th><th>Currency</th><th>Remaining gross</th><th>Evidence / eligibility</th></tr></thead><tbody id="m6-orders"></tbody></table></div><div class="azs-pagination"><button id="m6-order-prev" class="azs-btn secondary">Previous orders</button><button id="m6-order-next" class="azs-btn secondary">Next orders</button></div></section></div>
